    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d303-a1">

                <pb facs="0659" n="575" xml:id="pg575"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 158.—Tanslation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mariscal to Mr.
                            Jackson</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-02-18"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 18,
                        1886</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: I have had the honor of receiving
                    the esteemed note of your Excellency, dated the 15th instant, in which, by
                    instructions from your Government, you are pleased to advise me of the facts
                    connected with the skirmish which took place on the 10th of January last, near
                    Nacori, between a local force of Chihuahuans a detachment of American troops
                    under the command of Captain Crawford, who was mortally wounded.</p>
                <p>The attention of the Mexican Government had already been directed to the
                    occurrence to which your excellency refers, and in this department there is
                    being collected all the necessary data to form an exact idea of the same.</p>
                <p>Now, in view of the account of the facts contained in the note to which I reply,
                    a very careful investigation will be made to the end of ascertaining who were
                    the responsible parties in this lamentable affair.</p>
                <p>I renew to your excellency, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>IGN’O MARISCAL.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
